            "market-may",
            "hotel-realty-may"
          ],
          "facts": [
            "Seven columns across two joined mural-painted masses, three upper rows, two black iron escapes. West yellow field and east blue/cloud field separated by painted urban forms. Multipaned black sash and lower vents.",
            "Historical Bean shop is superseded and is not modeled.",
            "Current dated mural includes large black/white outlined tags across central cloud field, retained yellow west and blue east wall; duct stands proud of wall.",
            "Market food panels, loading hatch and corner hydrant; portions hidden by parked vehicles.",
            "Sweet Village Market Place occupies the east part; black fascia, oval cream logotype, white MARKET PLACE, individual juice/coffee/salad/sandwich poster fields and dark tagged piers.",
            "Separate EVH blue curtained window west. Gray exhaust duct rises to roof with bent top and circular fan base. No Ninth market cloth canopy or dining tables.",
            "147 west hotel entry and blue EVH window are distinct from market. Universal Realty Group has a navy sloped canopy, white lettering and separate east residential entry.",
            "345 has four bays and three upper rows; 343 has three bays and four upper rows, no escape. M8 bus stop in front of 345."
          ],
          "unknown": [
            "2024 primary Street View with explicitly dated 2017 access/architecture supplements, not an October 2026 field survey.",
